    description: "APPLIED 2026-08-18 (v1.64), Tyranid codex 1.05, confirmed by the author: \"Tyranids are now separated by KEYWORDS into Basic Bioforms and Advanced Bioforms. That makes a difference for buying Biomorphs from the Armory. Both Basic and Advanced Biomorphs are now paid per unit.\" WHERE THE KEYWORD LIVES: the KEYWORDS line of each datasheet, not the UNIT TYPE line — reading UNIT TYPE first gave Infantry/Monstrous Creature and nothing else, and dumping the whole sheet was what found it. Nine datasheets are Basic Bioform, thirty-one Advanced. WHAT THE TWO PRICE COLUMNS ACTUALLY MEAN: the Armory sheet prints \"Basic Bioform\" and \"Adv. Bioform\" columns, but every item allowed to both is priced the SAME in both (5/5, 0/0) — the only real difference is a \"-\", which the sheet preamble defines as \"can not be selected\". So this is an availability rule, not dual pricing: five Advanced Biomorphs (Implant Attack, Resonance Barb, Symbiote Rippers, Thornback, Tusked) are Advanced Bioform only. NEW: Camouflage (Advanced, 5) and Resonator (Special, on 24 datasheets at their own price). CHANGED: Extremely Volatile 5 to 0, Symbiote Rippers 3 to 5, and Combat Squads added to Hormagaunt, Termagant and Gargoyle Broods. THE TRAP THAT ALMOST SHIPPED: `optionQty` is keyed by choice INDEX, so the first pass — which rebuilt each group in the sheet's own order, dropping the five blocked entries and slotting Camouflage in alphabetically — would have silently repointed every saved Tyranid list at a different biomorph (Warped would have become Tusked on all 31 Advanced datasheets). Rebuilt index-stable instead: positions 0-15 are untouched, Camouflage is appended at 16, Resonator is appended to each Special group rather than inserted, and the five blocked choices STAY in the list, gated by a new `Choice.requires_keyword` the engine derives from the unit's keywords. A list saved before the split keeps its indices; if it holds a now-illegal Biomorph the validator says so and the choice can still be switched off. Verified in the running app: a Termagant Brood shows 17 Biomorphs with those five greyed and explained on hover, a Carnifex Brood shows all 17 selectable, and Termagant + Camouflage prices at 55.",
