    description: 'REMOVED 2026-07-24 (v1.56) at the codex author\'s request (Discord): "there is a selection for characters which unit they join. This is unnecessary, as it can be changed each round if they join or detach from a unit. And it doesn\'t matter for the deployment, either." Joining is an in-game decision, not a list-building one, so the picker no longer renders in the unit card. The joinedToUnit field and every engine consumer of it (Command Squad validation, the CSM Zombie-lord aura, the Chaos Daemons resolver, IG platoon grouping and print view) were deliberately left intact, so previously saved lists still resolve exactly as before and the picker can be restored by re-enabling a single block in UnitCard.tsx.',
